#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step Main Window"
msgstr "A xanela principal de Step"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To help you get started, &step; integrates a series of tutorials which "
"easily teach you how to build an experiment. Please see step by step to "
"start with the first tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Para axudalo a comezar, &step; trae uns titoriais que ensinan a construír un "
"experimento. Sígueos paso por paso desde o primeiro titorial."

